And as always happens when you give people a chance that they dimensionalize themselves in telling that story, and we stayed in that deal and we worked with those people and we had a good time.
正如往常一样，当你给人们一个机会，让他们在讲述这个故事时将自己维度化时，我们就留在了这笔交易中，我们与这些人一起工作，我们度过了一段愉快的时光。

00:26:22.359 --> 00:26:25.960
