Were there, what was on the bubble, but that made it in any way.
在那里，泡沫上有什么，但无论如何它都成功了。

00:50:12.500 --> 00:50:17.460
Many things, I guess, but so much of a disfictional.
我猜想，有很多事情，但是却非常矛盾。

00:50:17.460 --> 00:50:18.980
The character is not my wife.
角色不是我的妻子。

00:50:18.980 --> 00:50:26.900
There are aspects of my wife in there, but there are aspects of other people I've met along the way, some of whom I've even mentioned in this conversation, and some of it's just fiction.
其中有我妻子的一些方面，但也有我一路上遇到的其他人的一些方面，其中一些我什至在这次谈话中提到过，有些只是虚构的。

00:50:26.900 --> 00:50:31.739
So I felt pretty protected by the many different ingredients and all of these characters.
所以我感觉受到许多不同成分和所有这些角色的保护。

